Z||000000||Spyder||04-12-2000||02:38 PM||||I found this. Has any one done this mod on here. <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/mod.add.PW.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/mod.add.PW.html</A> <BR>Do I understand this right, you can order the oem window motor and install in the place of the crank (regulator)? or does it take more off of a donor?<BR>I don't have a problem with the wiring.||||reg||1
