Z||000003||Carrolles||04-13-2000||01:49 PM||||I bought a pair of doors that have power windows and power locks at the Fiero Factory Swap meet last year for $20 each.  I plan to install the regulators and locks into my 85SE soon.  I probably won't have it done before this years swap meet.<P>Ed suggests just swapping doors but I'm afraid to mess with the good alignment I have between my doors and the frame.<P>I got the correct color door panel map pockets from Ed to attach to my door panels.<P>I bought a rivet gun that will do 1/8", 3/16", and 1/4" rivets along with 25 of each size rivet from Harbor Freight for $16.00.||||reg||1
